      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BRUNSWICK BOY (5) hit the ground running off the cherry draw and never headed winning (23.44) at this track in Grade 5 over 411m. Has an impeccable record here. Form reads well for this. BONALL RETURNS (1) claimed maiden win two back then finished a 4.5 lengths second last start at this track over 411m (23.97). Returns to the course where he won his maiden. Leading player again. TENEILLE (2) stalked the lead from a middle draw and boxed on well to finish a nose back in second (23.45) at this track in a Grade 5 over 411m. Will give a great sight again. KOORINGA ELLSIE (3) is always hard to beat when she races here at this trip.",
